  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Inspect the source, slit, rotating eight-sided reflecting prism, distant two-mirror fold-back and telescope in one connected optical apparatus. Retain the full directed light path without showing a calculated rotation rate.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/10p/figures/fig-213.png",
      "sha256": "febeb5f2da74bcaa6c6a587d7c45c9c3831c6f7d9a56390c547069e8ffa18ce2"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c2-s3-t12 (zh); prose=[]",
        "exercise": "g0/1",
        "text": "1. 图213是迈克尔孙测定光速的实验示意图。光在整个往返路径中通过的总距离约为71千米。要在目镜中看见光源，旋转的八边棱镜每秒应转多少圈？\n约定：求返回光因棱镜转动而首次重新进入目镜时的非零最小转速；忽略空气中光速与真空中光速的差别。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "phy10-c2-s3-t12 (en); prose=[]",
        "exercise": "g0/1",
        "text": "1. Figure 213 shows Michelson's experiment for measuring the speed of light. The total distance traveled by the light along the complete outgoing and return path is approximately 71 kilometers. How many revolutions per second must the rotating octagonal prism make for the light source to be visible through the eyepiece?\nAssumption: find the smallest nonzero rotation rate for the first recurrence in which the returning light reenters the eyepiece as the prism rotates; neglect the difference between the speed of light in air and in vacuum."
      }
    ],
